+      <figure><span class="panel-shot"><img src="../../media/site/apps/polgar-pocket/libra-board.png" width="1264" height="1680" loading="lazy" alt="Pocket Chess Studies: Libra Colour simulator — brown board, normal text"></span><figcaption>Libra Colour simulator — brown board, normal text</figcaption></figure>
+      <figure><span class="panel-shot"><img src="../../media/site/apps/polgar-pocket/libra-revealed-170.png" width="1264" height="1680" loading="lazy" alt="Pocket Chess Studies: Libra Colour simulator — revealed solution at 170% text"></span><figcaption>Libra Colour simulator — revealed solution at 170% text</figcaption></figure>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+  <div class="wrap">
+  <section class="section prerequisites" aria-labelledby="prerequisites-title">
+    <h2 id="prerequisites-title">Before you install</h2>
+    <ol>
+      <li>No account or Wi-Fi needed. Includes twenty CC0 Lichess puzzles.</li>
+    </ol>
+  </section>
+  <section class="section" id="setup-panel">
+    <h2>New to Cobalt? Install it from your browser.</h2>
+    <p>Plug your Kobo into this computer and install Cobalt in about a minute. After that, apps install over Wi-Fi.</p>
+    <p class="quiet">Works in Chrome, Edge and Opera. <a href="https://github.com/BandarLabs/Cobalt/blob/main/docs/DEVICES.md#device-support-matrix">Check your Kobo is supported</a>.</p>
+    <p><a class="btn" href="../../install/">Install Cobalt</a></p>
+  </section>
+  <section class="section" id="pair-panel">
+    <h2>Already have Cobalt? Link your Kobo.</h2>
+    <p>On your Kobo, open <strong>App Store</strong> and tap <strong>Link a browser</strong> in the top bar, then <strong>Link a browser</strong> again. Scan the QR code, or enter the pairing code and verification key it shows.</p>
+    <form id="pair-form">
+      <div class="field">
+        <label for="pair-code">Pairing code</label>
+        <input id="pair-code" name="code" inputmode="text" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="8" required>
+      </div>
+      <div class="field" id="pair-secret-field">
+        <label for="pair-secret">Verification key</label>
+        <input class="secret" id="pair-secret" name="secret" inputmode="text" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" maxlength="45" required>
+      </div>
+      <button type="submit">Link Kobo</button>
+    </form>
+    <p class="status" id="pair-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
+  </section>
+  <section class="section" id="install-panel" hidden>
+    <h2>Install on <span id="device-name">your Kobo</span></h2>
+    <p>Your Kobo checks the app's signature before installing it.</p>
+    <div class="actions">
+      <button type="button" id="install">Install Pocket Chess Studies</button>
+      <button type="button" id="forget" class="secondary">Forget this Kobo</button>
+    </div>
+    <p class="status" id="install-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
+  </section>
+  <section class="section whats-new">
+    <h2>New in 0.2.0</h2>
+    <p>Initial Cobalt Beta submission: twenty CC0 Lichess demonstration puzzles, offline study and save-aware recovery.</p>
+  </section>
+  <section class="section">
+    <p class="after-index">Want another Kobo app? Request it, suggest a feature or report a bug in <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/CobaltForKobo/">r/CobaltForKobo</a>.</p>
+  </section>
+  </div>
+</main>
+<footer>
+  <div class="wrap">
+    <div>
+      <p>Cobalt is an independent project, not affiliated with Rakuten Kobo. Bluetooth, Wi-Fi and Kobo are trademarks of their owners; see <a href="https://github.com/BandarLabs/Cobalt/blob/main/TRADEMARKS.md">trademarks</a>.</p>
+      <p>AGPL-3.0. Source at <a href="https://github.com/BandarLabs/Cobalt">BandarLabs/Cobalt</a>.</p>
+    </div>
